{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41562","headline":"所思 · 张泌","name":"所思","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"空塘水碧春雨微，东风散漫杨柳飞。\n依依南浦梦犹在，脉脉高唐云不归。\n江头日暮多芳草，极目伤心烟悄悄。\n隔江红杏一枝明，似玉佳人俯清沼。\n休向春台更回望，销魂自古因惆怅。\n银河碧海共无情，两处悠悠起风浪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张泌","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41562.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41562","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}